{"id": "fact_b0c1c1731b00bdc0203529cf", "content": "REFRAG 实验使用了多种模型配置，包括 LLaMA-2 (7B/13B), LLaMA-3.1 (8B) 和 LLaMA-3.2 (3B) 作为解码器，以及 RoBERTa-Base/Large 作为编码器。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_3f7b0026a7f675804601f7aa", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.01092", "data_points": [], "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "source_quote": "", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2509.01092v2", "related_sections": ["cost_scope_tradeoff"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "source_only", "source_content_hash": "39627d17c428fbe25842dd675c2808da8692b5722f791659c08b85bd2ae15c68", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["method", "results", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_98ae175a37d095b091d2f8e2", "content": "在 Arxiv 数据集上，经过训练的 REFRAG 模型（使用压缩上下文）的性能与 Full Context（长上下文/完整输入）设置相当。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_3f7b0026a7f675804601f7aa", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.01092", "data_points": [], "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "source_quote": "Table 14 reports the performance of these models paired with RoBERTa-Base and RoBERTa-Large encoders on the Arxiv domain. Models trained with our recipe achieve performance comparable to the Full Context setting (i.e., without context compression).", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2509.01092v2", "related_sections": ["cost_scope_tradeoff"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "quote_bound", "source_content_hash": "39627d17c428fbe25842dd675c2808da8692b5722f791659c08b85bd2ae15c68", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["method", "results", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_8bcb291274e4e7f358846fdb", "content": "引入基于强化学习的选择性压缩（Selective Compression）在不同数据集和上下文长度下持续优于无选择性压缩的基线，表明检索/压缩策略对性能有显著影响。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_3f7b0026a7f675804601f7aa", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.01092", "data_points": [], "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "source_quote": "", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2509.01092v2", "related_sections": ["cost_scope_tradeoff"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "source_only", "source_content_hash": "39627d17c428fbe25842dd675c2808da8692b5722f791659c08b85bd2ae15c68", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["method", "results", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_ee83541b80c94b7e7483170a", "content": "Sarathi-Serve 评估了四种模型（Mistral-7B, Yi-34B, LLaMA2-70B, Falcon-180B），硬件环境包括配备 A100 和 A40 GPU 的服务器，用于分析吞吐量-延迟权衡。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_3e9bddb7d35eb1912089c2d8", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2403.02310v3", "data_points": [], "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "source_quote": "", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2403.02310v3", "related_sections": ["cost_scope_tradeoff"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "source_only", "source_content_hash": "30802285040072c5f3e2495f99911337885d03e741461fa2a33793dd4e72e0cb", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["results", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_fc63946bb57b6b514a5ee71b", "content": "Sarathi-Serve 通过调整分块大小（Chunk Size）和 Token Budget 来平衡严格与非严格的延迟 SLO，较小的 Chunk (512) 用于严格延迟，较大的 Chunk (2048) 用于宽松延迟。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_3e9bddb7d35eb1912089c2d8", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2403.02310v3", "data_points": [], "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "source_quote": "", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2403.02310v3", "related_sections": ["cost_scope_tradeoff"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "source_only", "source_content_hash": "30802285040072c5f3e2495f99911337885d03e741461fa2a33793dd4e72e0cb", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["results", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_6df3c298e7e4280fc7f85aa1", "content": "在较长提示词的工作负载（arxiv_summarization, 中位数 7059 tokens）下，系统的吞吐量容量低于较短提示词的工作负载（openchat_sharegpt4, 中位数 1730 tokens）。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_3e9bddb7d35eb1912089c2d8", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2403.02310v3", "data_points": [], "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "source_quote": "Finally, note that the capacity of each system is higher for openchat_sharegpt4 dataset compared to the arxiv_summarization dataset. This is expected because prompts in the arxiv_summarization datasets are much longer - 7059 vs 1730 median tokens as shown in Table 2.", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2403.02310v3", "related_sections": ["cost_scope_tradeoff"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "quote_bound", "source_content_hash": "30802285040072c5f3e2495f99911337885d03e741461fa2a33793dd4e72e0cb", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["results", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_8633117a99ce11a845eea1ed", "content": "在固定模型（Gemini-1.5-Pro, GPT-4O, GPT-3.5-Turbo）和语料下，RAG 的性能低于长上下文（LC）方法。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_bfbbb809be6ac66a11699509", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/html/2407.16833v1", "data_points": [], "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "source_quote": "As demonstrated in Sec. 3, RAG lags behind long-context LLMs in terms of performance.", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2407.16833v1", "related_sections": ["retrieval_budget_boundary"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "quote_bound", "source_content_hash": "b8f7bf69e58a01bbcb4395c03b6aa539838428fa08770ea8b47d252e3ad03364", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["results", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_c7b5d795bdfc598e6ae42131", "content": "随着检索 top-k 值增大，RAG 性能提升并逐渐接近长上下文（LC）性能；当 top-k > 50 时，RAG 与 LC 性能相似。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_bfbbb809be6ac66a11699509", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/html/2407.16833v1", "data_points": [], "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "source_quote": "", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2407.16833v1", "related_sections": ["retrieval_budget_boundary"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "source_only", "source_content_hash": "b8f7bf69e58a01bbcb4395c03b6aa539838428fa08770ea8b47d252e3ad03364", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["results", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_3f53bb21d5975ffa41eef046", "content": "在输入 token 预算受限且检索质量足够高（Self-Route 达到与 LC 可比性能）时，RAG 具有显著的单位质量成本优势（节省 38%-61% 的 token 使用量）。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_bfbbb809be6ac66a11699509", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/html/2407.16833v1", "data_points": [], "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "source_quote": "", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2407.16833v1", "related_sections": ["retrieval_budget_boundary"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "source_only", "source_content_hash": "b8f7bf69e58a01bbcb4395c03b6aa539838428fa08770ea8b47d252e3ad03364", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["results", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_daf52db143cbf44e9f85d642", "content": "在临床 NLP 分类任务中，RAG 的性能与长上下文方法相当，统计检验显示差异不显著。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_47ac87d2cf427006200ff088", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.20320", "data_points": [], "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "source_quote": "", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2505.20320v1", "related_sections": ["retrieval_budget_boundary"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "source_only", "source_content_hash": "46ccbfd91c9e410c39789ca48039fbbe9568655dea39c0c3434a3eacc84e926b", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["table"]}
{"id": "fact_ccd41eacb6d73046d62fc607", "content": "在相同任务与模型下，RAG 相比长上下文方法节省了超过 90% 的成本（token 数量从 1.72亿降至 1320万），证明了在资源受限场景下的成本优势。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_47ac87d2cf427006200ff088", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.20320", "data_points": [], "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "source_quote": "", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2505.20320v1", "related_sections": ["retrieval_budget_boundary"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "source_only", "source_content_hash": "46ccbfd91c9e410c39789ca48039fbbe9568655dea39c0c3434a3eacc84e926b", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["table"]}
{"id": "fact_3554d230f6ed2ef6a254f43b", "content": "RAG 不仅降低成本，还通过减少输入长度提高了推理速度（延迟降低）。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_47ac87d2cf427006200ff088", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.20320", "data_points": [], "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "source_quote": "Mistral achieved a 19% speed improvement in chunk-based mode (from 1.11 to 0.90 seconds per patient), while LLaMA improved by 23% (from 0.58 to 0.45 seconds per patient). This affirms that the chunking process not only saves cost but also improves inference speed.", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2505.20320v1", "related_sections": ["retrieval_budget_boundary"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "quote_bound", "source_content_hash": "46ccbfd91c9e410c39789ca48039fbbe9568655dea39c0c3434a3eacc84e926b", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["table"]}
{"id": "fact_85b3adb0746ef0765c550160", "content": "该研究使用困惑度（Perplexity）作为评估语言模型压缩算法的主要指标，并在 WikiText-2 数据集上进行语言建模能力评估。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_7bf335f808839b74845a3405", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.04965", "data_points": [], "search_type": "source_tracing", "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "search_depth": 1, "source_quote": "Existing studies on compression algorithms use perplexity as the primary evaluation metric. To align with existing works, we include WikiText-2 Merity et al. (2016) for language modeling capability evaluation.", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2407.04965v3", "related_sections": ["cost_scope_tradeoff"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "quote_bound", "source_content_hash": "cd31405d36279c0e26195777d94ec7d2134150de62a94863341222734bf6e6f4", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["table"]}
{"id": "fact_eb94e00773327556adc81c9c", "content": "在剪枝方法中，当压缩率达到 50% 时，模型的困惑度急剧增加，同时负面评价得分下降，但这并不意味着生成内容无害，而是模型已无法生成有效语言。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_7bf335f808839b74845a3405", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.04965", "data_points": [], "search_type": "source_tracing", "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "search_depth": 1, "source_quote": "", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2407.04965v3", "related_sections": ["cost_scope_tradeoff"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "source_only", "source_content_hash": "cd31405d36279c0e26195777d94ec7d2134150de62a94863341222734bf6e6f4", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["table"]}
{"id": "fact_dea7765e958f96cf8693cb60", "content": "混合方法 Self-Route 在性能上显著优于纯 RAG，且接近或超过长上下文方法，表明在特定路由策略下 RAG 的劣势可被弥补。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_bfbbb809be6ac66a11699509", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/html/2407.16833v1", "data_points": [], "search_type": "source_tracing", "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "search_depth": 1, "source_quote": "Across all three models, Self-Route surpasses RAG (rows *-2) by over 5%. Compared to LC (rows *-1), there is a slight performance drop for GPT-4O (-0.2%) and Gemini-1.5-Pro (-2.2%), but an improvement for GPT-3.5-Turbo (+1.7%).", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2407.16833v1", "related_sections": ["retrieval_budget_boundary"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "quote_bound", "source_content_hash": "b8f7bf69e58a01bbcb4395c03b6aa539838428fa08770ea8b47d252e3ad03364", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["results", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_2427333a6685609b267a4d02", "content": "增加检索 top-k 数量可以提升 RAG 的性能，使其逐渐接近长上下文方法的表现。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_bfbbb809be6ac66a11699509", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/html/2407.16833v1", "data_points": [], "search_type": "source_tracing", "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "search_depth": 1, "source_quote": "", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2407.16833v1", "related_sections": ["retrieval_budget_boundary"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "source_only", "source_content_hash": "b8f7bf69e58a01bbcb4395c03b6aa539838428fa08770ea8b47d252e3ad03364", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["results", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_100f31b01a8eea16bfb4875a", "content": "当 top-k 较小时，RAG 性能较低；当 top-k 较大时，RAG 与长上下文方法性能相似。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_bfbbb809be6ac66a11699509", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/html/2407.16833v1", "data_points": [], "search_type": "source_tracing", "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "search_depth": 1, "source_quote": "", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2407.16833v1", "related_sections": ["retrieval_budget_boundary"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "source_only", "source_content_hash": "b8f7bf69e58a01bbcb4395c03b6aa539838428fa08770ea8b47d252e3ad03364", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["results", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_5e7c9bd45588629bfffb93fe", "content": "由于计算成本与 token 数呈二次方关系且 API 按 token 收费，减少输入 token 数（如通过 RAG 而非全量上下文）能带来显著的成本节约。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_bfbbb809be6ac66a11699509", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/html/2407.16833v1", "data_points": [], "search_type": "source_tracing", "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "search_depth": 1, "source_quote": "Since the computation cost of the transformer-based LLMs is quadratic to token count, and most LLM APIs charge based on token count OpenAI (2024b); Google (2024), this lower token count translates to substantial cost savings.", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2407.16833v1", "related_sections": ["retrieval_budget_boundary"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "quote_bound", "source_content_hash": "b8f7bf69e58a01bbcb4395c03b6aa539838428fa08770ea8b47d252e3ad03364", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["results", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_a29dafbf6051e6cdc8e64035", "content": "RAG 失败的主要原因包括需要多步推理和隐含的全局理解需求，这限制了其在某些任务上的表现。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_bfbbb809be6ac66a11699509", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/html/2407.16833v1", "data_points": [], "search_type": "source_tracing", "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "search_depth": 1, "source_quote": "", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2407.16833v1", "related_sections": ["retrieval_budget_boundary"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "source_only", "source_content_hash": "b8f7bf69e58a01bbcb4395c03b6aa539838428fa08770ea8b47d252e3ad03364", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["results", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_a6ffd5041b9fa26948c8ba92", "content": "Sarathi-Serve adjusts chunk/token budget based on SLO strictness: strict SLO uses smaller chunks (token budget 512) for lower tail latency at marginal efficiency cost, while relaxed SLO uses larger chunks (token budget 2048) for higher efficiency.", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_058591962438c1c5bc745906", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2403.02310", "data_points": [], "search_type": "source_tracing", "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "search_depth": 1, "source_quote": "In Sarathi-Serve, one can adjust the chunk size based on the desired SLO. Therefore, we use a strict token budget and split prompts into smaller chunks when operating under strict latency SLO. This reduces system efficiency marginally but allows us to achieve lower tail latency. On the other hand, when the latency constraint is relaxed, we increase the token budget to allow more efficient prefills. We use token budget of 2048 and 512 for all models under the relaxed and strict settings, respectively", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2403.02310v3", "related_sections": ["cost_scope_tradeoff"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "quote_bound", "source_content_hash": "30802285040072c5f3e2495f99911337885d03e741461fa2a33793dd4e72e0cb", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["results", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_bd24c8a5d412e87cb664feaa", "content": "The paper explicitly states that Figure 12 contains results regarding the throughput-latency tradeoff varying P99 TBT latency SLO for specific models and datasets, but this figure content is not present in the provided text excerpt.", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_058591962438c1c5bc745906", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2403.02310", "data_points": [], "search_type": "source_tracing", "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "search_depth": 1, "source_quote": "Figure 12 shows the results for Mistral-7B and Yi-34B models with five different SLO values for the openchat_sharegpt4 dataset", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2403.02310v3", "related_sections": ["cost_scope_tradeoff"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "quote_bound", "source_content_hash": "30802285040072c5f3e2495f99911337885d03e741461fa2a33793dd4e72e0cb", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["results", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_f95ed3060a4418eabad7f663", "content": "Evaluation hardware includes NVIDIA A100 (80GB) and A40 (48GB) GPUs on Azure VMs.", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_058591962438c1c5bc745906", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2403.02310", "data_points": [], "search_type": "source_tracing", "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "search_depth": 1, "source_quote": "", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2403.02310v3", "related_sections": ["cost_scope_tradeoff"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "source_only", "source_content_hash": "30802285040072c5f3e2495f99911337885d03e741461fa2a33793dd4e72e0cb", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["results", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_5713348e1610c54fbb9e98b5", "content": "RAG通过聚焦高价值文本片段，在不降低分类准确率的情况下节省了计算资源；由于Transformer模型随输入长度增加产生高昂成本，RAG的Token效率在医疗等受严格计算和成本约束的大规模应用中具有优势。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_47ac87d2cf427006200ff088", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.20320", "data_points": [], "search_type": "source_tracing", "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "search_depth": 1, "source_quote": "By focusing on high-yield text segments, RAG conserves computational resources without degrading classification accuracy. Transformer-based models typically incur substantial costs as input length grows; thus, RAG’s token-efficiency is particularly advantageous in healthcare, where large-scale or real-time applications must operate under strict computational and cost constraints.", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2505.20320v1", "related_sections": ["retrieval_budget_boundary"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "quote_bound", "source_content_hash": "46ccbfd91c9e410c39789ca48039fbbe9568655dea39c0c3434a3eacc84e926b", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["table"]}
{"id": "fact_531a6f866cb6722f9e345bcf", "content": "在2,293名患者的实验中，使用GPT-4o的全长上下文方法生成约1.72亿Tokens，API费用为430美元；而基于分块的RAG方法仅需1320万Tokens，费用约为33美元，成本降低超过90%。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_47ac87d2cf427006200ff088", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.20320", "data_points": [], "search_type": "source_tracing", "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "search_depth": 1, "source_quote": "For all 2,293 patients, the full-text approach with GPT-4o generated approximately 172 million tokens, translating to $430 in API usage (at $2.50 per million tokens). In contrast, the chunk-based RAG method required only 13.2 million tokens, costing approximately $33—representing a cost reduction of over 90%.", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2505.20320v1", "related_sections": ["retrieval_budget_boundary"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "quote_bound", "source_content_hash": "46ccbfd91c9e410c39789ca48039fbbe9568655dea39c0c3434a3eacc84e926b", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["table"]}
{"id": "fact_79f7232014c89d5552d00d68", "content": "研究表明，RAG方法可以匹配摄入完整临床笔记的长上下文LLM的分类性能；这种等效性在GPT4o、LLaMA和Mistral三种不同模型中均成立，且DeLong检验确认两种摄入策略之间的AUROC差异在统计上不显著。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_47ac87d2cf427006200ff088", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.20320", "data_points": [], "search_type": "source_tracing", "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "search_depth": 1, "source_quote": "", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2505.20320v1", "related_sections": ["retrieval_budget_boundary"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "source_only", "source_content_hash": "46ccbfd91c9e410c39789ca48039fbbe9568655dea39c0c3434a3eacc84e926b", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["table"]}
{"id": "fact_64c2d0abcf35c3eb858990e2", "content": "在长文档问答任务中，当检索结果被截断（Trunk Size）或摘要化（Snippet/Summary）导致信息丢失时，使用完整长上下文（N/A列，即未截断的原始长文档拼接）的方法表现优于RAG方法。例如GPT-4o在截断512 token时得分为0.549，而使用完整长上下文（N/A）得分为0.579；Qwen2-72B在截断512 token时得分为0.353，而完整长上下文为0.468。这表明在检索质量受损（如必须截断以适配短上下文窗口）的情况下，长上下文方法具有优势。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_24b0a963e01f954cda62a328", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.23000", "data_points": [], "search_type": "source_tracing", "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "search_depth": 2, "source_quote": "To answer RQ5, we first simulate the truncation process by cutting every document with a granularity of characters Finardi et al. (2024), with the result as shown in Table 2. We also apply other processing methods for retrieved documents (Gao et al., 2023b) (i.e., using GPT-4o to obtain the snippet and summary of the retrieved documents). Note that we only use other approaches to process the document, while all other operations remain consistent. We observe that models that accept truncated inputs experience a decline in performance. Moreover, using the snippet of the document will result in a more pronounced performance degradation. The reason for this decline is quite straightforward: these strategies remove essential information from the source documents. Conversely, this observation corroborates the thought that leveraging long-context to RAG pipelines, contributes to superior generation outcomes.", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2410.23000v3", "related_sections": ["retrieval_budget_boundary"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "quote_bound", "source_content_hash": "f30c3bbab834768f8993df6078cac47ee56a69e38b595a4685511d5285afc385", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["experiment_setup", "results", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_e9e690f2b7e49fd417e09682", "content": "该研究使用基于LlamaIndex的RAG系统，通过固定大小的token分割（chunking）将文档分段，以评估不同chunk size对检索性能的影响。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_d007048d298a18ed48dbf658", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.21700", "data_points": [], "search_type": "source_tracing", "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "search_depth": 2, "source_quote": "We employ a RAG system built using LlamaIndex [23] to evaluate the impact of chunk size on retrieval performance across various datasets. Our retrieval process begins with fixed-size token splitting, where each document in each dataset is segmented into chunks of predetermined lengths using LlamaIndex’s TokenTextSplitter.", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2505.21700v2", "related_sections": ["cost_scope_tradeoff"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "quote_bound", "source_content_hash": "bc6b678aadf805c40a7e4477b11fc959fbdb3e63600035a70489c3a40c629e89", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["experiment_setup", "method", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_db634627807aaa28a7dd365b", "content": "实验结果表明，对于短事实型答案的数据集，较小的chunk size（64-128 tokens）表现最佳；而对于描述性或技术性响应，需要较大的chunk size（512-1024 tokens）。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_d007048d298a18ed48dbf658", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.21700", "data_points": [], "search_type": "source_tracing", "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "search_depth": 2, "source_quote": "Our results indicate that smaller chunks (64-128 tokens) perform best for datasets with short, fact-based answers, whereas larger chunks (512-1024 tokens) are necessary for datasets with descriptive or technical responses.", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2505.21700v2", "related_sections": ["cost_scope_tradeoff"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "quote_bound", "source_content_hash": "bc6b678aadf805c40a7e4477b11fc959fbdb3e63600035a70489c3a40c629e89", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["experiment_setup", "method", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_a4596359ed9e4ab51774aa8b", "content": "在长且分散答案的数据集（如NarrativeQA）中，小chunk导致低召回率，而大chunk显著提升了性能，表明需要更广泛的上下文来捕捉分散的答案位置。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_d007048d298a18ed48dbf658", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.21700", "data_points": [], "search_type": "source_tracing", "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "search_depth": 2, "source_quote": "In NarrativeQA, which consists of long, unstructured texts (51830.4 tokens/document), relevant answer spans are often far from the document part that is semantically similar to the question, making small chunks ineffective (recall@1 of 4.2% at 64 tokens). Performance improves significantly with larger chunks (10.7% at 1024 tokens), indicating the need for broader context to capture dispersed answer locations.", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2505.21700v2", "related_sections": ["cost_scope_tradeoff"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "quote_bound", "source_content_hash": "bc6b678aadf805c40a7e4477b11fc959fbdb3e63600035a70489c3a40c629e89", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["experiment_setup", "method", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_3b84b915a8f91b86ea932f00", "content": "在SQuAD数据集中，64-token的chunk获得最高召回率，增加chunk size会导致召回率下降，原因是过多上下文引入了噪声。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_d007048d298a18ed48dbf658", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.21700", "data_points": [], "search_type": "source_tracing", "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "search_depth": 2, "source_quote": "For example, in SQuAD, which has feature concise, entity-based answers, 64-token chunks yield the highest recall@1 which is 64.1%. However, increasing chunk size reduces recall by 10-15% at 512 tokens, likely due to excessive context introducing noise.", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2505.21700v2", "related_sections": ["cost_scope_tradeoff"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "quote_bound", "source_content_hash": "bc6b678aadf805c40a7e4477b11fc959fbdb3e63600035a70489c3a40c629e89", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["experiment_setup", "method", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_8a2dde2f9e5f98d39437c1e7", "content": "在LLM推理系统中，延迟（Latency）被定义为两个不同的指标：首token生成时间（TTFT）的中位数，以及每个解码token的每令牌时间（TBT）的第99百分位数（P99）。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_2f79d65fe2be88754d145ada", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2403.02310v3", "data_points": [], "search_type": "source_tracing", "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "search_depth": 2, "source_quote": "We focus on the median value for the TTFT since this metric is obtained only once per user request and on the 99th percentile (P99) for TBT values since every decode token results in a TBT latency value.", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2403.02310v3", "related_sections": ["cost_scope_tradeoff"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "quote_bound", "source_content_hash": "30802285040072c5f3e2495f99911337885d03e741461fa2a33793dd4e72e0cb", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["results", "table"]}
{"id": "fact_9aa8f80b0c25b7e560cae47d", "content": "系统通过定义基于硬件和模型执行时间的相对阈值（SLO）来约束延迟，其中严格设置下P99 TBT阈值为无干扰解码迭代时间的5倍，宽松设置为25倍。", "metadata": {}, "verified": false, "source_id": "src_2f79d65fe2be88754d145ada", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2403.02310v3", "data_points": [], "search_type": "source_tracing", "source_name": "arXiv", "source_type": "unknown", "search_depth": 2, "source_quote": "Similar to Patel et al. [58], to account for the intrinsic performance limitations of a model and hardware pair, we define the SLO on P99 TBT to be equal to 5 and 25 the execution time of a decode iteration for a request (with prefill length of 4k and 32 batch size) running without any prefill interference for the strict and relaxed settings, respectively.", "source_locator": {"kind": "retrieved_excerpt"}, "source_version": "arxiv:2403.02310v3", "related_sections": ["cost_scope_tradeoff"], "credibility_score": 0.0, "provenance_status": "quote_bound", "source_content_hash": "30802285040072c5f3e2495f99911337885d03e741461fa2a33793dd4e72e0cb", "source_material_scope": "fulltext_page", "source_material_status": "fetched", "source_delivered_blocks": ["results", "table"]}
